<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1526" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄδῠτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δύω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not to be entered</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θησαυρός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					11.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. ἐστιν ὁ τόπος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					14.1.44
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>never setting</i>, of stars, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Arat.
				632
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> mostly as
				Subst. (masc. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Merc.</u>
				247
			</span></i>, neut. in <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.72
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ion</u>
				938
			</span></i>), <i>innermost sanctuary</i> or <i>shrine</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				5.448
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				512
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Ap.</u>
				443
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐώδεος ἐξ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>O.</u>
					7.32
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ τοῦ ἀ. τῆς βίβλου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Tht.</u>
					162a
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. θαλάσσης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>H.</u>
					1.49
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hymn.Is.</u>
				152
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
